        "Description": "&quot;Florida Man&quot; in Miami was a secret lover of Emma Carlisle, a married in woman to the Carlisle throne. When she heard that Zachary authorised his contract and killed her father, she was so furious she poisoned him with the drug, now nicknamed Thisamin-47. The autopsy proved only confusion, yet the Head Butler Mr Fernsby saw what happened. He has defended with Emma to prevent family disunity. Madam Carlisle is in shock and has made a contract on them both.\r\rUse melee if no poison :D\r\rShkerrrr-",
